(level-mach)
*title Indirect guidance
*atmos standard
*earth spherical omega=0
*trajectory 1 aircraft start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=600 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=100
  *file level.dat time alt mach gamgd alpha power cl cd thrust
  *segment 1 cruise
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05 dtguid=5
    *aero cl=(aircraft-cl) cd=(aircraft-cd)
    *prop thrust=(engine-thrust) mdot=(engine-mdot)
    *fly gamgd=0
    *fly mach=0.55
    *fly bankgd=0
    *fly betae=0
    *when time=20 stop
*end
